backup/*

new configurations:
  - config files now use native toml instead of ini.
  - all code has been converted to use new configs

logging:
  - src/lib/log.py now take VERBOSE option from configs
  - print() functions have been replaced with log() to conform to VERBOSE behaviour

plots:
  - plots have been extended to their own module.
  - plots now take an OPENFIG and SAVEFIG option from config
  - if SAVEFIG is true, then plots will be saved to the ./figures directory
  - if OPENFIG is true, then plots will be opened in a new window

directories:
  - added new ./tmp directory for data that is in-between processes.

run:
  - run.py executes entire pipeline. data is passed via data.toml.